                                      Table "musicbrainz.l_artist_work"
     Column     |           Type           | Collation | Nullable |                  Default                  
----------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+-------------------------------------------
 id             | integer                  |           | not null | nextval('l_artist_work_id_seq'::regclass)
 link           | integer                  |           | not null | 
 entity0        | integer                  |           | not null | 
 entity1        | integer                  |           | not null | 
 edits_pending  | integer                  |           | not null | 0
 last_updated   | timestamp with time zone |           |          | now()
 link_order     | integer                  |           | not null | 0
 entity0_credit | text                     |           | not null | ''::text
 entity1_credit | text                     |           | not null | ''::text
Indexes:
    "l_artist_work_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (id)
    "idx_l_artist_work_e0_e1" btree (entity0, entity1)
    "idx_l_artist_work_entity0_link_entity1" btree (entity0, link, entity1)
    "idx_l_artist_work_entity1_link_entity0" btree (entity1, link, entity0)
    "l_artist_work_idx_entity1" btree (entity1)
    "l_artist_work_idx_uniq" UNIQUE, btree (entity0, entity1, link, link_order)
Check constraints:
    "l_artist_work_edits_pending_check" CHECK (edits_pending >= 0)
    "l_artist_work_link_order_check" CHECK (link_order >= 0)

